    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111854" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλύαξ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱκος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱλαροτραγῳδία</span>
			, <i>tragic burlesque,</i> invented by Rhinthon, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλύᾱκες τραγικοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.414
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Noss.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>jester,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τάρας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.149
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				884.26
			</span></i> (ubi <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλοίακες</span></b> ).</div>
